=== long-formats-cold-resume.tsv ===
# Cold resume (review R3-01): fresh copy, stored checkpoint at depth_h, new service: load (open + zero-tolerance seek) then play().
# status_after_load must be paused (a slow open is .preparing while it lasts, never .failed). Environment: simulator iPhone18,3, iOS 26.5 (23F77), Debug build, output at 1 % volume (quiet test runs); at the start: host load averages 7.72 21.71 32.43 (1, 5, 15 min), 4 simulators booted on the host when the test run started
# load_1m = the host's 1-minute load average when the trial ended (review R4-02: open and first-seek times grow with the host's load)
